 "description": "<p>Åndehullet&nbsp;[622-2] is a travellers&#39; hut, located on the south side of Weaseløen, the island south of the southernmost of Orienteringsøerne in Dove Bugt.&nbsp;</p><p>Note: Due to possible damage by polar bears the present condition of the hut is unknown.&nbsp;</p><p>Number in brackets [ ] refer to hut number in PS Mikkelsen:&nbsp;North-East Greenland 1908-60. &nbsp;The Trapper Era. The Scott&nbsp;Polar Research Institute (2008). &nbsp;</p>",
